  <prompt>Port H2bAiSearchIndexHandler.cs's provisioner collaborator (DeployAllIndexesScriptProvisioner -&gt; ai-search/Deploy-AllIndexes.ps1, 637 lines: az search admin-key show x2, az keyvault secret x1, az webapp config x1; index bodies pushed via REST inside the script) to Azure.Search.Documents.Indexes.SearchIndexClient with UAMI RBAC auth -- DELETES the admin-key handling entirely (a security improvement, not just a mechanical swap). Index JSON definitions become embedded resources/content files (the script's inline REST bodies). CRITICAL: also build the REAL AI Search tenant-filter template provisioner, replacing StubAiSearchTenantFilterTemplateProvisioner (which currently just logs and returns Success with zero actual template provisioning -- DS-4 flags this as 'I2 provisioning half not real', the corresponding VERIFIER is already real per DS-4, only the provisioner side is stubbed).</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in Azure.Search.Documents.Indexes.SearchIndexClient with RBAC (not admin-key) authentication, and authoring tenant-filter index templates enforcing unconditional tenantId eq predicates.</role>

  <goal>H2bAiSearchIndexHandler.cs's provisioner is a pure .NET SearchIndexClient implementation under UAMI RBAC (zero admin-key handling anywhere in the collaborator). The 7 canonical index definitions (per Deploy-AllIndexes.ps1's catalog authority, this project's CLAUDE.md canonical-implementations table) are embedded content files, create/verified via SDK calls. A real AiSearchTenantFilterTemplateProvisioner exists, replacing the Stub, actually provisioning the tenant-scoped filter template (not just logging success).</goal>

  <context>
    <background>DS-4 §2 (H2b row) classifies this as PARTIAL: 'provisioner = pwsh Deploy-AllIndexes.ps1; verifier = real REST; StubAiSearchTenantFilterTemplateProvisioner logs+Success (C3.7 -- I2 provisioning half not real).' DS-1b §1 (H2b row, collaborator #8) confirms the SDK mapping and the security improvement ('UAMI RBAC auth -- deletes the admin-key handling entirely'). This project's own CLAUDE.md names scripts/ai-search/Deploy-AllIndexes.ps1 as 'the H2b canonical exemplar -- script IS the catalog authority' for the 7-index set.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/Handlers/AiSearchIndex/H2bAiSearchIndexHandler.cs</file>
