    <criterion testable="true">AiSearchTenantFilterTemplateProvisioner actually provisions a template artifact (test asserts a create/write call occurred, not merely a logged success message).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the template already exists, re-running the provisioner is a no-op (idempotency test).</criterion>
